    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Fintan Cahill Auctioneers are delighted to present this exceptional detached bungalow to the market. Finished to an impeccable standard throughout, this superb home combines generous living space with outstanding craftsmanship and attention to detail. \r\n\r\nThe accommodation is thoughtfully laid out, beginning with a welcoming entrance hallway. To the front of the property is an elegant formal sitting room, while further along the hallway a beautifully designed utility room with guest WC leads into the heart of the home – a magnificent open-plan kitchen/dining area fitted with high-quality cabinetry and modern appliances. From the kitchen, there is seamless access to a second comfortable living room and a bright conservatory, creating an ideal space for both family life and entertaining. \r\n\r\nThe bedroom accommodation is equally impressive. The ground floor features a luxurious family bathroom, a spacious double bedroom, and an exceptionally large primary bedroom. A versatile additional room, suitable as a home office, gym, or bedroom, provides access to two further first-floor rooms, currently used as a bedroom and a storage room. \r\n\r\nEvery aspect of this property reflects a commitment to quality, with premium finishes, stylish décor, and meticulous attention to detail evident throughout. \r\n\r\nA fully equipped covered brick-built barbecue area is complemented by a substantial seating area set beneath a beautifully crafted timber pergola, creating the perfect space for outdoor dining and social gatherings. There is also a separate patio area featuring a stone table and benches, ideal for enjoying the surrounding gardens. In addition, the property benefits from an enclosed timber garden room – perfect for year-round outdoor entertaining.  \r\n\r\nA notable feature of the property is the extensive concrete yard to the rear, served by two substantial workshop units offering approximately 5,000 sq. ft. of versatile workspace.  \r\n\r\nThis is a rare opportunity to acquire a turnkey home of exceptional quality, where no expense has been spared in creating a stylish and comfortable living environment."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
