        "Content": "Exceptionally maintained and presented property \r\nHigh end finishes throughout \r\nMature gardens \r\nFantastic outdoor facilities including covered pergola & barbecue \r\nExtensive yard with two workshops \r\nOil fired central heating \r\nSeptic tank \r\nGroup scheme water"
      }
